1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
Hi, we're team RADAR UNIT.

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:04,700
The problem: cameras miss floods
hiding under trees and clouds.

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:07,400
Radar doesn't, and that's our challenge:
Dancing with the SARs.

4
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,840
This is DELTA PULSE:
revealing the water we cannot see.

5
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:10,960
Type in any place on Earth.

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,660
DELTA PULSE streams real NISAR data
from NASA archive

7
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,660
and maps the hidden water in seconds.

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:18,760
For example, at Mason Neck,
flooded forest grew by 40%.

9
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,640
Imagine fishers, farmers
and water managers

10
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:23,380
watching their wetlands breathe
throughout any storm,

11
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,670
anywhere on Earth, every 12 days.

12
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:28,470
DELTA PULSE:
feel the pulse of the planet's water.

13
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,510
Thank you.

